8. credit_card covers card recommendations, fees, rewards, Visa/Mastercard product questions, 办卡/开卡/刷卡优惠. "信用卡开户/开卡" is credit_card only, not hsbc_account.
9. remittance_tuition / remittance_living cover tuition or living-cost transfers; overseas_spending covers 换汇/购汇/汇率/境外消费. hsbc_account covers bank account opening (开户/汇丰账户), not credit cards.
10. visa_documents is for immigration/study visas. Do not treat "Visa卡" / "visa card" as visa_documents.
11. Study-prep questions that name several topics (visa, tuition remittance, account opening, credit card) should return all matching intents.
12. Normalize values to the option values and types described by ALLOWED_FIELDS.

